       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STATFUNCS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-MEDIAN PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 WS-RANGE PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-MIDRANGE PIC 9(3)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE WS-MEDIAN = FUNCTION MEDIAN(5 1 9 3 7)
           COMPUTE WS-RANGE = FUNCTION RANGE(5 1 9 3 7)
           COMPUTE WS-MIDRANGE = FUNCTION MIDRANGE(5 1 9 3 7)
           DISPLAY "MEDIAN: " WS-MEDIAN
           DISPLAY "RANGE: " WS-RANGE
           DISPLAY "MIDRANGE: " WS-MIDRANGE
           STOP RUN.
